# Local IDE / tool state for the `docs/` vault.
# These are per-user artifacts that must not enter version control:
# - `.obsidian/` is the Obsidian vault config (workspace layout, plugin
#   toggles, graph layout) — varies per machine.
# - `.claudian/` is the Claudian plugin's local state (user settings,
#   chat session history) — per-user, contains ephemeral data.
# See docs/DOCS_CONVENTIONS.md for the docs/ directory contract.
.obsidian/
.claudian/
